OL,3,GNEWSA'I watched Apollo 17 launch with
OL,4,ANeil Armstrong'
OL,5,
OL,6,FNearly 54 years ago, Apollo 17 blasted
OL,7,Foff from the Kennedy Space Center in
OL,8,FFlorida, bound for the moon.
OL,10,FStanding alongside legendary astronauts
OL,11,Flike Neil Armstrong and Dick Gordon, a
OL,12,Fschoolboy from Lancashire was there to
OL,13,Fsee the final manned lunar landing
OL,14,Fmission.
OL,16,FAhead of the screening of a documentary
OL,17,Fabout his experience, Preston
OL,18,Fastronomer Dermot Gethings recalled
OL,19,Fhow, at 16 years old, he was hand
OL,20,Fpicked by the United States embassy and
OL,21,FNasa to witness the launch.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,403,400,260,160,0,100
