OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'I watched Apollo 17 launch with
OL,4,ANeil Armstrong'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"As it launched there was this
OL,7,Fincredible adrenaline and a shockwave
OL,8,Fthat rattled every bone in your body,"
OL,9,Fsaid the now 70-year-old of the events
OL,10,Fof 7 December 1972. "It is the stuff
OL,11,Fthat you dream about."
